---
title: "emergencyWithdraw/pause/unpause/syncLegionAddresses (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_dispatch: determine admin action
    q_dispatch --> q_emergency: action == emergencyWithdraw
    q_dispatch --> q_pause_action: action == pause
    q_dispatch --> q_unpause_action: action == unpause
    q_dispatch --> q_sync: action == syncLegionAddresses
    q_emergency --> q_check_auth_op: legionOperator only
    q_check_auth_op --> q_do_emergency: authorized
    q_check_auth_op --> q_revert: unauthorized
    q_do_emergency --> [*]: transfer specified token to address, emit EmergencyWithdraw
    q_pause_action --> q_do_pause: legionOperator authorized
    q_do_pause --> [*]: paused = true, emit Paused
    q_unpause_action --> q_do_unpause: legionOperator authorized
    q_do_unpause --> [*]: paused = false, emit Unpaused
    q_sync --> q_read_registry: read addressRegistry
    q_read_registry --> [*]: update Legion addresses, emit AddressesSynced
    q_revert --> [*]: revert Unauthorized

    note right of q_dispatch
        INV-001: emergency/pause/unpause/sync restricted to legionOperator
        INV-002: pause preserves investor fund access
        INV-003: syncLegionAddresses updates from central registry
    end note
